{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x8f69ofe","slide":6,"text":"7:00–8:10 · Medium-run result\n15 / 89 subgoals finished (17%) → 0 final proofs verified.\nDefinition: finished means the controller ledger recorded the local subgoal as accepted. It does not mean the complete theorem was independently proved.\nThirteen runs reached their configured run limit. Configurations allowed up to 200 agent steps; the individual limits were not identical.\nFive of twenty runs were hand-reviewed as search/recovery loops; four of those five reached their run limit.\nFour of twenty were hand-reviewed as subgoal-scope mismatches: work progressed on a local objective that did not align with the needed proof step.\nSources: data/experiments/qwen_medium_subgoals_v1/summary.json; docs/lean_easy_failure_report/lean_failure_modes_meeting.md; docs/lean_easy_failure_report/config/meeting-experiments.mjs."}
